	date = {2019},
	keywords = {Multiobjective optimization, Renewable energy resources, Energy management systems, Renewable energy sources, Particle swarm optimization ({PSO}), Hybrid power systems, Microgrids, Distributed power generation, Wind, Smart Micro Grids, Wind turbines, energy storage, Optimisation, Particle swarm optimisation, Photovoltaic power systems, Smart power grids, Photovoltaic effects, Energy Storage Systems ({ESSs}), Demand response, Wind speed, Solar cells, Solar irradiances, load growth, /hydrogen tank {MGs} system, battery storage plants, Controllable loads, different components, different constraints, Ekbatan complex, Ekbatan residential complex, energy storage systems capacity, high renewables penetration, microgrids including renewable energy resources, minimizing power loss, multiobjective optimisation problem, particle swarm optimisation algorithm, Particle swarm optimisation algorithms, pilot case study, place, Rate of increase, Reliability and power qualities, {RERs} uncertainties, Residential complexes, size, smart {MGs}, smart microgrid components, solar irradiance, wind turbine/{PV}/fuel cell},
