	volume = {38},
	issn = {02540096},
	url = {https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-85017511071&partnerID=40&md5=e9e2ead72a505da034fd8a30509fd472},
	abstract = {Aiming at the problem of low efficiency and high cost of renewable energy power generation, multi objective optimization design of wind solar hybrid system with hybrid energy storage system is made by using multi objective particle swarm optimization ({CMOPSO}) algorithm. Firstly, the mathematical model of the cost, the loss of load probability and the energy loss rate of the micro grid are established. Secondly, the {CMOPSO} algorithm is compared to the classic multi objective optimization algorithm {NSGA}-{II} to indicate the superiority of {CMOPSO}. Finally, multi objective optimization design of micro grid with single energy storage and hybrid energy storage using {CMOPSO} and {NSGA}-{II} algorithm is carried out. Two objective optimization analysis is made considering the reliability and cost, and then three objective optimization analysis is made considering the reliability, cost and loss rate of energy consumption. The results showed whether it is to consider two goals or three goals, micro grid system with the hybrid energy storage is cost effective comparing the single energy storage system. © 2017, Editorial Board of Acta Energiae Solaris Sinica. All right reserved.},
