	abstract = {This paper introduces a novel optimized droop control employing the Centripetal Force-Gravity Search Algorithm ({CF}-{GSA}), a metaheuristic multi-objective evolutionary algorithm. The proposed method aims to enhance droop performance, focusing on power sharing, voltage and frequency stability, and power quality. {CF}-{GSA}, specifically designed to address local solution issues common in optimization algorithms, has been demonstrated to be effective and superior through a series of simulations. The simulation results affirm the proposed multi-objective optimization droop control method's capability to rectify issues arising from power sharing errors in isolated {AC} {MGs} dealing with high inductive loads and changes in line impedance. © 2024 {IEEE}.},
